### ─── AUTH: Register, Login, Refresh, Logout ─────────────────────────


### Requiere http-client.env.json en http/ o en la raíz del proyecto


### Variables: Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000/api/v1


### Health check

GET http://localhost:5000/health HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


### Register (default: student)

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Register como admin

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "name": "Admin User",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "admin"
}


### Register como instructor

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "instructor@test.com",
  "name": "Instructor User",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "instructor"
}


### Register como moderator

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moderator@test.com",
  "name": "Moderator User",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "moderator"
}


### Login

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Refresh (requiere cookie refreshToken)

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "pegar-acá-el-token"
}


### Logout

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{}
